OL,3,GNEWSAControversial reservoir plan      
OL,4,Asubmitted to government                
OL,6,FControversial plans for a proposed new 
OL,7,F150-billion-litre reservoir in the     
OL,8,FThames Valley have been submitted to   
OL,9,Fthe government.                        
OL,11,FThames Water has lodged its planning   
OL,12,Fapplication for the White Horse        
OL,13,FReservoir, near Abingdon in            
OL,14,FOxfordshire, with the Planning         
OL,15,FInspectorate.                          
OL,17,FThe water company said the new         
OL,18,Freservoir, which could cost #7.5bn to  
OL,19,Fconstruct, would secure water supply   
OL,20,Ffor 15 million people across the south 
OL,21,Feast.                                  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
