OL,3,GNEWSAControversial reservoir plan      
OL,4,Asubmitted to government                
OL,6,FBut local councils and campaigners have
OL,7,Fcalled on the government to throw out  
OL,8,Fthe plans, due to concerns including   
OL,9,Fflooding and the impact on wildlife.   
